# Thirty background pages put to sleep: the timed pass no unit test reaches with a real page,
# run here with a one-second threshold (from://debug?sleepTabs) instead of waiting an hour.
budget rss=800 stalls50=70   # each new tab stalls ~100 ms today (Nov 2026)
from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=first
wait 3
helpers baseline
pace 0.3
repeat 30 from://open?url=${PAGE}?n=${i}
from://action/nextTab
wait 4
from://debug?sleepTabs=1
wait 4
expect-log tab sleep (unloads|discards)
helpers settle 2
